WEBVTT

00:00:08.900 --> 00:00:14.560
Rieze asked me over so she could
share some information on Sir Krusty.

00:00:14.560 --> 00:00:16.150
Us, too.

00:00:16.150 --> 00:00:19.770
If I remember correctly,
he's on the Zhongyuan server, right?

00:00:19.770 --> 00:00:22.400
I wonder how they got in touch with him.

00:00:23.560 --> 00:00:29.020
The Summoner team summoned flying
creatures and crossed the server border.

00:00:29.020 --> 00:00:31.440
They used the Castling spell
and switched bodies.

00:00:31.440 --> 00:00:33.480
Um, why are you in that outfit?

00:00:33.480 --> 00:00:37.900
I see. Telepathic calls can work
once you cross the server border.

00:00:37.900 --> 00:00:38.720
Actually...

00:00:38.720 --> 00:00:43.230
Shiroe. There's something
milord wants to tell you.

00:00:43.230 --> 00:00:44.850
What? Me?

00:00:44.850 --> 00:00:46.400
To explain...

00:00:47.060 --> 00:00:49.600
...we turned it into a puppet show.

