00:02:20.600 --> 00:02:23.560
Why a puppet show?

00:02:23.560 --> 00:02:26.650
Takayama said it'd be easier
to understand that way.

00:02:26.650 --> 00:02:29.270
She isn't a real-life
day-care teacher for nothing.

00:02:29.270 --> 00:02:34.350
We can explain to you guys
and the princess all at once this way.

00:02:34.350 --> 00:02:38.730
I helped them make the puppets,
making full use of my power of femininity.

00:02:38.730 --> 00:02:42.810
Oh... That frog from the other day...

00:02:42.810 --> 00:02:44.400
