00:03:14.170 --> 00:03:18.980
"Oou"

00:03:15.020 --> 00:03:20.100
On that day, deep, deep in
the mountains in the Oou region,

00:03:20.100 --> 00:03:22.520
Takayama's weapon went out of control,

00:03:22.520 --> 00:03:26.480
milord went missing...

00:03:26.480 --> 00:03:30.060
...and I lost my right arm.

00:03:30.060 --> 00:03:34.730
We were told milord was
transferred to the Zhongyuan server.

00:03:34.770 --> 00:03:37.730
Zhu Huan, Lelang Wolf 
Cavalry - Guild Master

00:03:36.520 --> 00:03:38.350
Is that...

00:03:38.850 --> 00:03:40.600
...a monster?

00:03:40.600 --> 00:03:42.940
Is this some sort of an event?

00:03:42.940 --> 00:03:46.060
No, what I see on his back is...

00:03:43.810 --> 00:03:47.240
Gumon

00:03:46.060 --> 00:03:47.980
...an Adventurer.

00:03:48.850 --> 00:03:54.850
Saved by Mr. Zhu Huan,
the Guild Master of Lelang Wolf Cavalry,

00:03:54.850 --> 00:03:58.440
he was taken to the Bai Tao Shrine in
the enchanted land, on Mount Lang Jung.

00:03:58.440 --> 00:04:00.510
Mount Lang Jung

00:04:01.170 --> 00:04:02.760
Bai Tao Shrine

00:04:03.230 --> 00:04:05.980
What's the "enchanted land," my lord?

00:04:05.980 --> 00:04:08.190
It's a place where immortal wizards live.

00:04:08.190 --> 00:04:09.650
In this place live martenfolks,

00:04:09.650 --> 00:04:13.150
spirits that called themselves
officials of the heavens.

00:04:13.150 --> 00:04:17.560
They assumed milord was an
immortal wizard and took care of him.

00:04:17.560 --> 00:04:20.480
Master Immortal, your meal is ready.

00:04:20.480 --> 00:04:21.980
It's already lunchtime?

00:04:21.980 --> 00:04:22.740
That sounds like Krusty!

00:04:22.740 --> 00:04:24.770
Takayama is impressive!

00:04:24.910 --> 00:04:27.910
Bai Tao Shrine Style Twice Cooked Pork Lunch Set

00:04:27.950 --> 00:04:31.910
Krusty, D.D.D - Guild Master

00:04:30.270 --> 00:04:31.980
It's delicious.

00:04:31.980 --> 00:04:35.770
Glad to hear that. You're a
difficult person to please, Master Immortal.

00:04:32.040 --> 00:04:35.920
Hua Diao
- Martenfolk -
Heavenly Official

00:04:36.230 --> 00:04:37.480
You think so?

00:04:37.480 --> 00:04:40.980
Master Zhu Huan sent us some food.

00:04:40.980 --> 00:04:42.650
That's great. I appreciate that.

00:04:42.650 --> 00:04:46.190
Chicken, wild boar, deer,
mountain pheasant, and duck.

00:04:46.190 --> 00:04:49.230
We've got white wheat and brown wheat, too!

00:04:49.230 --> 00:04:51.350
Is that why you look so happy?

00:04:52.270 --> 00:04:54.560
It's not like that.

00:04:54.560 --> 00:04:56.600
Were there honey and eggs as well?

00:04:58.850 --> 00:05:02.150
Okay, then. I'll make
the dessert for our dinner.

00:05:05.270 --> 00:05:06.850
Thank you for the lunch.

00:05:08.810 --> 00:05:12.060
Hm? Sniff, sniff. Sniff, sniff.

00:05:12.060 --> 00:05:13.480
Hua Diao.

00:05:14.100 --> 00:05:16.440
Could you change the bed sheets?

00:05:16.440 --> 00:05:18.850
C-Certainly!

00:05:20.940 --> 00:05:23.190
Good afternoon, Master Krusty.

00:05:25.690 --> 00:05:28.810
You look well as always,
Madam Enchantress Youren.

00:05:28.840 --> 00:05:31.010
Enchantress Youren

00:05:31.650 --> 00:05:35.650
How are you feeling, physically?
How is your memory?

00:05:35.650 --> 00:05:37.850
There are no particular problems.

00:05:37.850 --> 00:05:44.350
Without him knowing, milord was
given a curse, a level 150 negative status.

00:05:44.350 --> 00:05:45.070
A curse?

00:05:45.070 --> 00:05:47.270
Level 150?

00:05:47.270 --> 00:05:51.310
Soul Darkness Curse.
HP's natural recovery becomes suspended.

00:05:51.310 --> 00:05:58.060
HP recovery by healing spells,
facilities, or items becomes impossible.

00:05:58.060 --> 00:06:00.310
Telepathic links become suspended.

00:06:00.310 --> 00:06:03.560
Moving around by crossing
server borders becomes impossible.

00:06:03.560 --> 00:06:06.060
Memories become lost.

00:06:06.060 --> 00:06:07.270
Memories?!

00:06:07.270 --> 00:06:09.190
Not all of them.

00:06:09.190 --> 00:06:13.810
The memory loss is random,
making it impossible to know the rules.

00:06:13.810 --> 00:06:17.480
I've never heard of a negative status like that.

00:06:17.480 --> 00:06:22.230
Is he trying to tell me about
the enemy that can give such a curse?

00:06:22.230 --> 00:06:25.480
No, it can't be that simple, right?

00:06:25.480 --> 00:06:26.690
Then...?

00:06:28.940 --> 00:06:33.020
Milord's HP was about 5300 at the time,

00:06:28.990 --> 00:06:40.830
Krusty
- Human -
Guardian

00:06:33.020 --> 00:06:37.270
which is around half of his max HP,
and it didn't recover.

00:06:37.270 --> 00:06:41.440
I may not look it,
but I do administer healing mystical arts.

00:06:41.440 --> 00:06:47.020
If you permit, I would like
to brew some elixir of life for you.

00:06:47.020 --> 00:06:49.940
I don't really like bitter tastes, so...

00:06:49.940 --> 00:06:52.350
What an uninteresting person.

00:06:52.350 --> 00:06:56.480
I can't trust her,
but not to the point that I hate her.

00:06:59.230 --> 00:07:01.400
Unlike her...

00:07:01.520 --> 00:07:03.310
...or her...

00:07:03.650 --> 00:07:05.940
I don't find it fun to tease this woman.

00:07:10.690 --> 00:07:16.190
At any rate, this is... quite boring.

00:07:18.060 --> 00:07:21.270
Meanwhile, there was a group
that was traveling on the Eured Continent

00:07:21.270 --> 00:07:24.690
on the Zhongyuan server,
the same server milord is on.

00:07:26.600 --> 00:07:30.730
Bam! Bang! Ka-pow!

00:07:30.730 --> 00:07:32.230
There she is! It's Kanami!

00:07:32.230 --> 00:07:35.150
Shiroe's ex-girlfriend!

00:07:35.150 --> 00:07:36.650
E-Ex-girlfriend?!

00:07:36.650 --> 00:07:38.100
That's not true!

00:07:38.100 --> 00:07:39.480
Kanami, a Monk.

00:07:39.480 --> 00:07:41.150
Coppelia, a Cleric.

00:07:41.150 --> 00:07:43.060
Leonardo, an Assassin.

00:07:43.060 --> 00:07:47.730
There it is, my lord! That green thing
is the fruit of my femininity power!

00:07:47.730 --> 00:07:49.730
R-Right.

00:07:49.730 --> 00:07:51.940
It's well made.

00:07:51.940 --> 00:07:56.350
Chung Lu, a member of
Lelang Wolf Cavalry, as a guide.

00:07:56.350 --> 00:07:57.560
And...

00:08:02.230 --> 00:08:05.690
Elias Hackblade, a Blademancer.

00:08:03.540 --> 00:08:08.550
Elias Hackblade 
- Elf - Blademancer -
Knights of the Red Branch

00:08:05.690 --> 00:08:08.650
Elias? You mean "the Charging Elf"?

00:08:08.650 --> 00:08:10.270
I know of him, too!

00:08:10.270 --> 00:08:14.060
He's the one on the
Elder Tales' game packaging, right?

00:08:14.060 --> 00:08:15.480
So he really does exist!

00:08:15.480 --> 00:08:20.190
To think that an Ancient hero
is traveling with Adventurers...

00:08:20.190 --> 00:08:22.520
That's our Kanami!

00:08:31.100 --> 00:08:32.770
Don't fight alone, Elias!

00:08:32.770 --> 00:08:34.400
We'll help Eli-Eli!

00:08:34.400 --> 00:08:35.730
Yes, Master.

00:08:35.730 --> 00:08:36.940
Okay!

00:08:41.690 --> 00:08:44.810
Here we go! Ka-pow!

00:08:44.810 --> 00:08:46.560
Deadly Dance!

00:08:46.560 --> 00:08:51.810
Her group was traveling with
Yamato--Japan--as their destination.

00:08:51.810 --> 00:08:54.270
What? They're headed this way?

00:08:54.270 --> 00:08:58.310
They think the cause of the Apocalypse
is the Elder Tales' new expansion pack,

00:08:58.310 --> 00:09:01.060
"Novasphere Pioneers."

00:09:01.060 --> 00:09:03.980
Since Japan is the only place
in the world where it launched,

00:09:03.980 --> 00:09:06.810
they're headed to the Yamato server.

00:09:04.520 --> 00:09:06.940
Highland Fire Dragon

00:09:11.400 --> 00:09:13.360
Highland Fire Dragon

00:09:55.020 --> 00:09:59.810
Cease to exist. Get chilled
to the bone, shiver, and freeze.

00:09:59.810 --> 00:10:02.940
Puppets. Cease to exist.

00:10:02.940 --> 00:10:07.730
Hand over your Empathium
that protects you and cease everything.

00:10:07.730 --> 00:10:09.690
Cease the artificial history.

00:10:09.690 --> 00:10:11.770
Cease the artificial memories.

00:10:11.770 --> 00:10:13.900
Cease the artificial feelings.

00:10:13.900 --> 00:10:17.190
Cease the timeline
of the artificial personalities.

00:10:28.650 --> 00:10:32.230
So Geniuses had appeared there too, huh?

00:10:32.230 --> 00:10:36.980
Novasphere Pioneers wasn't launched
on the Zhongyuan server, though.

00:10:36.980 --> 00:10:38.350
So why...?

00:10:41.690 --> 00:10:44.900
The fairy blood that runs
through my body brought me

00:10:44.900 --> 00:10:48.650
not only the power to fight,
but a curse as well.

00:10:48.650 --> 00:10:53.400
A fairy curse that prevents me
from killing my foe...

00:10:53.460 --> 00:10:55.300
Highland Fire Dragon

00:10:54.190 --> 00:10:57.850
I cannot reduce their HP
to less than 25 percent.

00:11:02.690 --> 00:11:05.730
Is there something you want from me, Miss?

00:11:05.730 --> 00:11:07.480
I am Youren.

00:11:07.480 --> 00:11:12.440
I live nearby and am a lower-ranked enchantress.

00:11:12.440 --> 00:11:13.850
An enchantress?

00:11:13.850 --> 00:11:18.600
My ability is far lower than yours,
but I am one of the Ancients, too.

00:11:18.600 --> 00:11:22.150
Am I correct to assume
you are Lord Elias Hackblade?

00:11:22.150 --> 00:11:23.350
Indeed I am.

00:11:23.350 --> 00:11:26.810
I have a request for you, Lord Elias.

00:11:26.810 --> 00:11:31.650
The Bai Tao Shrine in the enchanted land
that is about 20 ri to the south

00:11:31.650 --> 00:11:33.980
is controlled by a ferocious magus,

00:11:33.980 --> 00:11:37.440
and those who live nearby
are terrified by its violence.

00:11:37.440 --> 00:11:40.400
A magus? Could it be a Genius?

00:11:40.400 --> 00:11:43.850
I prostrate myself before you, Lord Elias.

00:11:43.850 --> 00:11:46.770
Please suppress this magus.

00:11:51.440 --> 00:11:56.150
Hm? Enchantress Youren went
to see Krusty too, didn't she?

00:11:56.150 --> 00:11:58.480
Things are starting to smell very fishy.

00:12:06.980 --> 00:12:10.770
--It's peach! It's peach!
--Looks yummy!
--It smells very good!

00:12:13.270 --> 00:12:14.900
The dessert is gone!

00:12:14.900 --> 00:12:17.100
--He's eaten it!
--Even the plate!

00:12:17.100 --> 00:12:19.730
We wanted to eat it!

00:12:19.730 --> 00:12:21.730
It's still here.

00:12:23.060 --> 00:12:25.230
Bring small plates.

00:12:28.560 --> 00:12:31.100
I'm acting like a day-care teacher.

00:12:31.100 --> 00:12:33.810
I bet she'll laugh.

00:12:34.940 --> 00:12:37.190
"She"?

00:12:39.020 --> 00:12:42.770
The partial loss of my memories is causing
no trouble with my current situation.

00:12:42.770 --> 00:12:46.690
But I must know what's causing it.

00:12:47.480 --> 00:12:50.060
It seems I need to go down to the village.

00:12:50.060 --> 00:12:52.150
You can't climb down the mountain.

00:12:52.150 --> 00:12:56.730
The cavern that connects to the
village requires you to be... let's see...

00:12:56.730 --> 00:13:01.900
...in a group of four to six Adventurers
at level 80 or higher to go through it.

00:13:01.900 --> 00:13:06.150
Eating that baked dessert with
vanilla ice cream is the proper way.

00:13:06.150 --> 00:13:07.480
Vanilla?

00:13:07.480 --> 00:13:12.770
It's a cold and sweet creamy ice dessert.
Don't you know it?

00:13:12.770 --> 00:13:14.770
No, I don't.

00:13:14.900 --> 00:13:18.770
If I go down to the village,
I might be able to find the ingredients for it.

00:13:21.520 --> 00:13:24.690
Okay then! So that you can go down the mountain,

00:13:24.690 --> 00:13:27.850
I'll assist you as a heavenly official!

00:13:29.350 --> 00:13:30.690
Piece of cake.

00:13:32.790 --> 00:13:36.000
"Bai Tao Shrine Style Ramen:
Extra-Extra Vegetables,
Extra Meat,
Extra Garlic, Goat Slime"

00:13:37.190 --> 00:13:39.150
After hearing Elias's story,

00:13:39.150 --> 00:13:43.270
Kanami's group decided
to head to the Bai Tao Shrine.

00:13:43.270 --> 00:13:47.980
To get there, they had to go through
the dungeon called Sirius Grotto.

00:13:44.460 --> 00:13:55.980
Sirius Grotto Entrance

00:13:47.980 --> 00:13:52.730
This dungeon is only for a group
of four to six people, levels 80 to 90.

00:13:52.730 --> 00:13:56.100
Since Lord Elias is level 100,
he can't go inside.

00:13:56.100 --> 00:13:57.770
That is ridiculous!

00:13:57.770 --> 00:14:00.310
Don't worry. We'll just go check how things are.

00:14:00.310 --> 00:14:04.150
If it looks dangerous,
we'll come back. It's just a recon.

00:14:04.150 --> 00:14:05.650
He's right. It's a recon.

00:14:05.650 --> 00:14:07.230
Sightseeing!

00:14:07.230 --> 00:14:09.940
Master. That means tourism.

00:14:11.900 --> 00:14:13.650
I'm going in first!

00:14:13.650 --> 00:14:16.520
Oh, hey, wait up! Kanami!

00:14:26.900 --> 00:14:28.850
Lord Elias.

00:14:38.230 --> 00:14:40.900
Are you worried about Elias?

00:14:40.900 --> 00:14:41.560
Yeah.

00:14:41.560 --> 00:14:44.060
Then why did you leave him behind?

00:14:46.770 --> 00:14:51.600
Eli-Eli looked scary,
like he had a fight with someone.

00:14:51.600 --> 00:14:54.190
So I thought it'd be better
for him to stay behind.

00:14:54.190 --> 00:14:58.350
It's definitely not good to enter
a dark cavern with a face like that.

00:14:58.350 --> 00:14:59.040
Right?!

00:14:59.040 --> 00:15:01.190
Coppelia does not quite understand, Master.

00:15:01.190 --> 00:15:04.900
Coppe is kinda cold!

00:15:04.900 --> 00:15:07.650
Coppelia has no negative status effects.

00:15:07.650 --> 00:15:11.650
Lord Elias is someone who
is like a cloudless sky in spring,

00:15:11.650 --> 00:15:15.400
but spring is also a season of thunderstorms.

00:15:15.400 --> 00:15:18.190
Thunderstorms, huh?

00:15:21.560 --> 00:15:24.400
You can go down the mountain from here.

00:15:24.400 --> 00:15:27.190
If you go that way,
you'll get to the steppe city.

00:15:27.190 --> 00:15:29.400
I'm sure they also sell sweets there.

00:15:30.400 --> 00:15:32.100
Yeah, I can imagine.

00:15:34.190 --> 00:15:36.440
Get some, please?

00:15:42.020 --> 00:15:44.230
I did not realize there was a route like this.

00:15:44.230 --> 00:15:49.020
Those Adventurers seem to assume
if there's a route through the dungeon,

00:15:49.020 --> 00:15:51.560
they must go through there.

00:15:55.940 --> 00:15:57.310
Who is that?

00:15:57.310 --> 00:15:59.060
It might be the magus.

00:16:10.690 --> 00:16:13.810
Master Immortal. Where's your cloud?

00:16:13.810 --> 00:16:18.980
My cloud? Oh, the kind
immortal wizards ride when they fly...

00:16:18.980 --> 00:16:20.980
My cloud is on vacation.

00:16:20.980 --> 00:16:21.500
What?

00:16:21.500 --> 00:16:24.230
My cloud is on a three-day workweek.

00:16:24.230 --> 00:16:25.440
What?!

00:16:29.500 --> 00:16:33.840
Krusty
- Human - Guardian -
D.D.D Guild Master

00:16:29.940 --> 00:16:34.270
Oh...? It seems you're as strong as a raid boss.

00:16:34.270 --> 00:16:37.190
Finally... This is more like it.

00:16:37.190 --> 00:16:38.980
Don't waste your breath!

00:16:49.520 --> 00:16:51.850
Elias Hackblade.

00:16:51.900 --> 00:16:55.360
Elias Hackblade
- Elf - Blademancer -
Knights of the Red Branch

00:16:52.150 --> 00:16:56.190
You're not even worthy
 of knowing my name.

00:16:56.190 --> 00:16:58.100
Master Immortal...

00:17:01.770 --> 00:17:06.770
O Fairy of Pure Water, transform
into a blade 10,000 feet long and shine!

00:17:06.770 --> 00:17:08.980
Aqua Thousand Rain!

00:17:15.190 --> 00:17:16.980
Hyperion Eye!

00:17:20.650 --> 00:17:24.190
Hyperion Eye is milord's oral art.

00:17:21.970 --> 00:17:24.310
Oral Art: Hyperion Eye

00:17:24.600 --> 00:17:29.150
When Elder Tales was just a game,
your view was from above.

00:17:29.150 --> 00:17:32.440
One of the causes for the increased
difficulty of battles after the Apocalypse

00:17:32.440 --> 00:17:35.350
was that your viewpoint
was fixed on your own head,

00:17:35.350 --> 00:17:38.810
which made it difficult to grasp information.

00:17:38.810 --> 00:17:43.520
But this oral art can
overcome that inconvenience.

00:17:52.980 --> 00:17:56.100
You are strong, hero Elias.

00:18:01.180 --> 00:18:05.100
Krusty 
- Human - Guardian -
 D.D.D Guild Master

00:18:01.350 --> 00:18:03.310
I can't beat him.
I need a way out of this situation.

00:18:03.310 --> 00:18:06.650
My battle abilities aren't high enough. So...

00:18:06.650 --> 00:18:08.400
...I can just increase them!

00:18:18.240 --> 00:18:20.620
Krusty 
- Human - Guardian -
 D.D.D Guild Master

00:18:20.850 --> 00:18:23.900
Where is that power... coming from?!

00:18:23.900 --> 00:18:25.350
War Cry...!

00:18:26.440 --> 00:18:29.190
Scarlet Thrust!

00:18:31.600 --> 00:18:34.190
Awwwwww!

00:18:34.190 --> 00:18:36.850
He's so wooly and cute!

00:18:36.850 --> 00:18:40.980
There, there. You like it here?

00:18:37.630 --> 00:18:40.980
He's one awfully friendly monster.

00:19:09.230 --> 00:19:10.520
Ahh!

00:19:22.480 --> 00:19:25.690
Master Immortal!

00:19:27.100 --> 00:19:28.400
Around the same time,

00:19:28.400 --> 00:19:32.020
a group was headed to Mount Lang Jung
where milord and Elias were.

00:19:32.020 --> 00:19:34.230
Let's hurry, guys!

00:19:34.230 --> 00:19:35.810
Yeah!

00:19:35.810 --> 00:19:41.020
I didn't realize the Guild Derby
has started. We got behind!

00:19:41.020 --> 00:19:46.060
The Guild Derby is a popular event
on the Zhongyuan server in Elder Tales.

00:19:46.730 --> 00:19:51.440
A Coronation Altar suddenly
appears near an enchanted land,

00:19:51.440 --> 00:19:55.770
and the guild that gets there first
and holds the Ritual of Coronation

00:19:55.770 --> 00:19:59.480
can obtain the right to
control the surrounding area.

00:20:01.090 --> 00:20:08.100
"Crimson"

00:20:01.440 --> 00:20:04.230
And now, a guild called the Crimson King Faction

00:20:04.230 --> 00:20:08.350
was after the altar that
appeared on Mount Lang Jung.

00:20:08.350 --> 00:20:11.440
If those good-for-nothings had
the right to control the area, who knows

00:20:11.440 --> 00:20:14.190
what they'd do to the
People of the Land around here!

00:20:14.190 --> 00:20:16.100
We gotta stop them no matter what!

00:20:26.940 --> 00:20:32.190
The strongest knight who has never won, huh?

00:20:32.690 --> 00:20:36.270
Lord Elias. Lord Elias!

00:20:36.270 --> 00:20:39.480
Ahh... Are you all right?

00:20:39.480 --> 00:20:41.900
I failed to kill a Genius.

00:20:41.900 --> 00:20:43.770
I was watching.

00:20:44.480 --> 00:20:45.390
I am sorry.

00:20:45.390 --> 00:20:51.100
Some abnormal power was affecting that fight.

00:20:51.100 --> 00:20:54.020
It was the power of the rainbow.

00:20:54.020 --> 00:20:55.850
The power of the rainbow?

00:20:58.310 --> 00:20:59.610
Krusty 
- Human - Guardian -
 D.D.D Guild Master

00:21:00.150 --> 00:21:03.060
That power originally
belonged to the enchanted land.

00:21:03.060 --> 00:21:07.730
He acquired it only because
this mountain came under his control.

00:21:09.650 --> 00:21:14.690
Furthermore, the magus is trying
to find the ruins hidden on this mountain.

00:21:14.690 --> 00:21:18.100
If he holds the Ritual of Coronation
at the altar found there,

00:21:18.100 --> 00:21:22.020
the area surrounding here
will come under his control.

00:21:22.020 --> 00:21:26.980
To save this land,
we still need your help, Lord Elias.

00:21:29.230 --> 00:21:32.310
Please hold the Ritual of Coronation.

00:21:35.150 --> 00:21:39.600
Then you will acquire a fragment
of the power of the rainbow.

00:21:39.600 --> 00:21:43.900
Acquire the power of the rainbow
to relieve yourself from the fairy curse.

00:21:45.560 --> 00:21:47.900
The curse...

00:21:47.900 --> 00:21:53.650
I will shatter and dispose
of this curse that binds me.

00:22:09.100 --> 00:22:10.770
Krusty...!

00:22:10.770 --> 00:22:12.770
He's in a fix, my lord!

00:22:12.770 --> 00:22:16.650
Kanami... A Genius... Ancients...

00:22:16.650 --> 00:22:18.980
There's too much information to grasp!

00:22:18.980 --> 00:22:22.100
What in the world does Krusty want to tell me?!

00:22:22.100 --> 00:22:25.230
Wh-What is going to happen?!

00:22:29.980 --> 00:22:32.730
The end... of Part One!

00:22:32.730 --> 00:22:36.020
Now we're... taking a bathroom break!

