00:24:12.730 --> 00:24:15.940
Hero Elias has fallen into
the evil hands of Enchantress Youren

00:24:15.940 --> 00:24:18.270
and makes an attack on Krusty and Kanami.

00:24:18.270 --> 00:24:22.690
Will the shout of Leonardo,
who rushed to the spot, reach him?

00:24:22.690 --> 00:24:25.270
During the battle, his cursed soul

00:24:25.270 --> 00:24:29.150
tears off the rigid chains that
had bound him down all this time.

00:24:29.150 --> 00:24:31.480
Next Time: "Not A Curse."

